---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
description: "Learning songs by ear: how to transcribe solos, riffs and bass lines, practise them slowly, and get them right. From the makers of EarBee."
permalink: /blog/
---
{#- The blog's page: every post, newest first. -#}
<section class="blog">
  <h1>Blog</h1>
  <p class="section-intro">
    {{ site.blogDescription }} <a href="/blog/feed.xml">RSS feed</a>
  </p>
  <ol class="post-list">
    {%- for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
    <li>
      <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
      <p class="post-meta">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        {%- if post.data.draft %} · <strong>draft</strong>{% endif %}
      </p>
      <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    </li>
    {%- else %}
    <li><p>No posts yet.</p></li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>
